    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
    "body": "You should not use `.data` in general.\nIf you want to detach from the autograd graph, you can use `.detach()`\nBut within a custom Function forward, since autograd is already disabled, you can just do return `x.view(x.shape)`",
