    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
    "body": "Why would you expect `e` to require gradients here given that it was created in no_grad mode?\nI agree that it is inconsistent with the non-custom Function case though indeed.\n\nThe reason is that \"detach()\" is a non-differentiable view. And so the output of the custom Function is not considered a view of its input. Leading to slightly different handling downstream.",
